and then the page scrolls. On normal phones the block screen looks the same as before.\n- Fixed Device Admin closing right away on some phones such as Xiaomi when anti-uninstall was already on. Ripple now lets the activation page open while Device Admin is not active, and still blocks the deactivation page once it is active.\n- Stronger anti-uninstall protection in Xiaomi's Security app. The app info page there (uninstall, force stop, clear data) is now blocked too.\n- Some HyperOS versions do not allow Device Admin for anti-uninstall. If the activation page still closes right away after updating, use Advanced Protection instead.\n- This update is for Android only. The iPhone version stays at v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 25\nsha256: 25465f51dd2e6e8be0809cfee65eed40381e865536b8a6741c6d82c581ba2a87\n", "version": "0.1.10", "versionCode": 25, "apkSizeBytes": 9191693, "sha256": "25465f51dd2e6e8be0809cfee65eed40381e865536b8a6741c6d82c581ba2a87", "ipaSizeBytes": 7764400, "ipaSha256": "3b7fca162f27b7033e45fe762f59587214bb7cb2c9cd1f4dcf047afb4f472f0f", "iosVersion": "0.1.5", "downloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.10.apk", "iosDownloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "mirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.10.apk", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.10/ripple-v0.1.10.apk", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.10/ripple-v0.1.10.apk", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.10/ripple-v0.1.10.apk"], "iosMirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa"]}